abstract: >-
  Code, configuration, derived tables, generated figures and provenance records
  for a study of analytical percolation thresholds used as infrastructure
  robustness screens. The package includes the finite-network estimator with
  exact endpoint evaluation, finite degree-preserving controls, a locked
  reference allowance evaluated with a cohort split and a disclosed sensitivity
  case, a constant-offset comparator, response-definition robustness records and
  control order- and swap-budget ladders. Raw third-party source archives are not
  redistributed; retrieval locations and use conditions are recorded in
  DATASETS_AND_LINKS.csv.
